      "ok": true,
      "stdout": "Set a text segment animation of one type (upsert/replace).\r\nReplaces the same animation type when it already exists.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n          --ref TEXT          Unified draft reference\r\n          --seg-id <SEG_ID[,SEG_ID...]> ... \r\n                              Target segment id; repeat --seg-id or pass a comma-separated list\r\n          --seg-type <TYPE[,TYPE...]> \r\n                              Target segment type(s): video, audio, text, sticker\r\n          --target-track <INDEX[,INDEX...]> \r\n                              Target track index(es)\r\n          --seg-index <INDEX[,INDEX...]> \r\n                              Comma-separated segment indexes within one target track, e.g.\r\n                              0,2,-1\r\n          --time-window <START,END> \r\n                              Select segments overlapping the half-open timeline window\r\n                              [start,end); start must be less than end\r\n          --resource TEXT REQUIRED \r\n                              Animation resource: vimo://<id> / local://<path>\r\n          --animation-type TEXT \r\n                              Text animation type: in/out/loop (default in)\r\n          --duration <duration> \r\n                              Animation duration; use us, ms, or s. Explicit unit required: us,\r\n                              ms, s, or min; bare numbers and m are invalid.\r\n          --start <duration>  Animation start; use us, ms, or s. Explicit unit required: us,\r\n                              ms, s, or min; bare numbers and m are invalid.\r\n          --slot-index TEXT   Zero-based visible text-template slot; omit to apply every\r\n                              visible slot. Unitless whole-number index.\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  # Set an in-animation on a text segment (replaces any existing in-animation)\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft text animation set --seg-id <UUID> --resource vimo://123 --animation-type in\r\n  # Set a loop-animation with an explicit duration and start offset\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft text animation set --seg-id <UUID> --resource vimo://456 --animation-type loop --duration 800ms --start 0us\r\n  # Set only visible slot 1 of a text template\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft text animation set --seg-id <UUID> --resource vimo://789 --animation-type in --slot-index 1\r\n",
